    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡρο-θετέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take note</i> of a thing <i>in casting a nativity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἄρη καὶ τὸν Κρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.160
				</span></i>
