				Lucill.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be in the ascendant at the natal hour,</i> of one's ruling
			planet, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροθετεῖ σε Κρόνος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				161
			</span></i> (Id.).</div>
